			"notes": "## Minecraft 26.2 and 26.3 support\n\n- **Paper / Spigot / Bukkit / Purpur / Folia**: the 26.x jar now officially supports 26.1, 26.2 and 26.3.\n- **Fabric / Quilt, Forge, NeoForge**: new builds for **26.3** and **26.2** (alongside 1.21.4). Download the jar that matches your Minecraft version.\n\n## Fixes (mod loaders)\n\n- Forge/NeoForge: removing netherite upgrade templates from loot now actually works (the loot modifier was never registered before).\n- Disabled-recipe datapack now uses the current recipe and pack formats, so recipe blocking applies on 1.21.4 and 26.x.\n- The periodic purge now checks armor and offhand slots on every supported version.\n- `/nonetherite` shows the real mod version on Forge/NeoForge.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/codingsushi79/nonetheriteplus/compare/v1.6.0...v1.6.1"
		},
